  "notes": "FORMS:\n{校|こう} (examine, check) + {閲|えつ} (review, inspect) → examine and review\n{校閲|こうえつ}する (to proofread, to review)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {校閲者|こうえつしゃ} (proofreader)\n- {校閲|こうえつ}{部|ぶ} (proofreading department)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {校正|こうせい} (proofreading - more focused on typographical errors)\n- {査読|さどく} (peer review - academic)\n- {編集|へんしゅう} (editing)\n- {推敲|すいこう} (polishing one's writing)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{校閲|こうえつ} involves checking for factual accuracy, consistency, and appropriateness of content, in addition to language errors. {校正|こうせい} is more focused on fixing typos, formatting, and ensuring the proof matches the original. {校閲|こうえつ} is a more comprehensive review.",
